<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Huntco raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded Huntco Inc to buy from accumulate following a recent 15 percent decline in the price of the shares and the firm's expectation that Huntco will enjoy a strong earnings recovery.</p>
<p>-- Left earnings estimates unchanged at $1.10 per share for 1997 and $2.10 per share for 1998.</p>
<p>-- Said saw &quot;reasonable potential for a doubling of the stock price.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Twelve to 18 month price target is &quot;at least $20.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 10-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
